{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_034_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7521d49feebfe680b76a58d0402c7dfd916316905eeacf009ebe014a0f3dae9e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a142d8afb5c336cf245858710f8178baba796316e77a14e7b2b60450b1126264",
      "text": "哇啊……从●●●●プロデューサー那里\n收到巧克力了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bc9d7f58560dc1c4618e443c3c8f3703d5bc30bd3d2ad84e1ff92880d60c050",
      "text": "太好啦太好啦！花音超级开心！\n谢谢你♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4544354b5639ce19075ddcf894f291b1585fbb1215e86790302d0e82c664ec39",
      "text": "每一个都好可爱，看起来好好吃！\n我都不知道该先吃哪一个了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b2ec95a08ba76195cac51d2dff67621e9ffbcceaa79f5369b7d51df4ade4af6",
      "text": "……唔——，\n现在选不出来，还是等会儿再决定吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d0fd3ce300aba5a232ec2671bfa3927d948247b7093854bf27b546ae0d2489e",
      "text": "制作人肯定也很想知道吧，\n等我决定好先吃哪一个了再告诉你哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a14686264b1a2d16eb50aac439435a2c42663ac772d9616efdb26dba54bd5879",
      "text": "哇啊，是要给花音巧克力吗？\n谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee8cfc2159ebfe29027deebefb87b684989bec3af0207e6695f30bb68e37e2c6",
      "text": "嘿嘿，是情人节巧克力～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d160d093680ea6a069af12d9ff70d25da87c9e8eb965ef032a573d76786e447b",
      "text": "这个是要送给重要的人的对吧？\n花音知道哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1498ef0803f20480d4381a58f7049b10322fa9fd353b067b2d893b0b55cb97c",
      "text": "跟你说哦，花音也\n超～级喜欢●●●●プロデューサー哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8747d72fc3c53ffc577351f02d44c2d2578378f7838ec1baede4da751c96f1b9",
      "text": "比如一直都对我那么温柔，比如为了大家\n一直都超级努力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96891e417d45112dd7a70012a4dad6da8326e1d14fe7a8166af86d7c1c0ad108",
      "text": "还有，最喜欢花音这一点也是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_b:cmd-000042:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_b:cmd-000043:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c351897a0dd50923c7a72471e4c2fdd8d99f8912e9e4d7dd326973ee4b2811d",
      "text": "今后我也会继续加倍努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_034_22:5_01_034_22_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0ebeec3979e5ab4458a0a5edb2fac6c7e783ae70ee650073fb2a16a8199e9a2",
      "text": "嗯！花音也会和制作人\n一起加油的～！今后也请多关照哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
